body:
Balance hook for a wallet screen in React Native. It polls every 30 seconds and refetches when the app regains focus. I am unsure about double fetching when both fire together, and about showing a stale balance right after a transfer. The core of it:

const { data } = useQuery(['balance'], fetchBalance, { refetchInterval: 30000 });

Is it fine to rely on the interval, or should the transfer screen force a refetch?
